WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.978 --> 00:00:16.079
Gildong went to Lord Hong's room.

2
00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:20.861
Lord Hong heard soft footsteps.

3
00:00:20.881 --> 00:00:22.902
"Who's out there?"

4
00:00:23.362 --> 00:00:24.323
Lord Hong asked.

5
00:00:24.343 --> 00:00:34.603
"Gildong." Lord Hong opened the doors and saw Gildong wearing a hat.

6
00:00:34.623 --> 00:00:38.426
"What are you doing here?

7
00:00:39.467 --> 00:00:40.768
Why are you dressed like that?"

8
00:00:42.469 --> 00:00:44.671
"I've come to say good-bye," Gildong said.

9
00:00:44.691 --> 00:00:47.273
"What do you mean good-bye?"

10
00:00:48.514 --> 00:00:49.634
Lord Hong frowned.

11
00:00:49.654 --> 00:00:51.556
"It is late.

12
00:00:52.537 --> 00:00:53.477
Go back to your room."

13
00:00:55.539 --> 00:00:56.820
Gildong knelt down.

14
00:00:59.872 --> 00:01:01.873
"I have decided to leave Your Lordship's house.

15
00:01:02.954 --> 00:01:05.335
Tonight an evil man was sent to harm me."

16
00:01:10.138 --> 00:01:10.718
Who sent him?"

17
00:01:11.119 --> 00:01:12.139
Lord Hong asked.

18
00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:15.941
Gildong thought for a moment.

19
00:01:17.062 --> 00:01:19.283
The truth would break Lord Hong's heart.

20
00:01:19.303 --> 00:01:22.565
"It doesn't matter," Gildong said.

21
00:01:22.585 --> 00:01:24.827
"But it's not safe for me here.

22
00:01:26.107 --> 00:01:27.108
Please don't worry about me.

23
00:01:30.176 --> 00:01:33.017
Because I am lowborn, I cannot serve the king like you can.

24
00:01:34.038 --> 00:01:35.218
I cannot call you Father.

25
00:01:41.140 --> 00:01:42.901
I must go and find my own destiny."

26
00:01:47.223 --> 00:01:48.703
Lord Hong looked troubled.

27
00:01:48.723 --> 00:01:51.545
"I'm afraid it will not be easy.

28
00:01:52.405 --> 00:01:53.445
But I won't stop you.

29
00:01:54.666 --> 00:01:56.407
Never forget that you are my son.

30
00:01:57.267 --> 00:01:59.668
And always remember to do good in the world."

31
00:02:02.280 --> 00:02:02.640
"I will.

32
00:02:03.261 --> 00:02:04.922
Farewell, Your Lordship."

33
00:02:06.724 --> 00:02:08.405
Gildong stood up and bowed.

34
00:02:10.386 --> 00:02:15.651
Then he disappeared into the night, leaving his father—and his home.

35
00:02:20.034 --> 00:02:23.717
For days Gildong wandered the country with nowhere to go.

36
00:02:25.518 --> 00:02:27.340
He didn't know what would happen to him.

37
00:02:33.596 --> 00:02:35.498
Eventually he came to the mountains.

38
00:02:37.320 --> 00:02:39.822
He stopped on a high ridge and looked out.

39
00:02:39.842 --> 00:02:43.305
"The world is so big.

40
00:02:45.287 --> 00:02:47.109
And I'm all alone now," he thought.

41
00:02:47.129 --> 00:02:49.291
"At least I have my fan."

42
00:02:56.778 --> 00:02:59.060
Feeling tired, he decided to sleep.

43
00:03:05.780 --> 00:03:08.142
A while later something stirred him awake.

44
00:03:09.843 --> 00:03:12.324
He looked around but saw nothing unusual.

45
00:03:14.385 --> 00:03:16.166
Gildong stood up and stretched.

46
00:03:16.186 --> 00:03:19.488
"Oh no!

47
00:03:19.888 --> 00:03:21.009
My fan is gone!"

48
00:03:22.610 --> 00:03:25.452
He saw a young girl far ahead on the path.

49
00:03:26.872 --> 00:03:28.013
She had the fan.

50
00:03:28.033 --> 00:03:31.655
"Hey! That's mine!"

51
00:03:31.955 --> 00:03:32.916
Gildong yelled.

52
00:03:34.208 --> 00:03:35.489
The girl turned around.

53
00:03:35.509 --> 00:03:37.469
"It's mine now!

54
00:03:38.090 --> 00:03:39.210
Thank you, little lord!"

55
00:03:39.850 --> 00:03:42.371
She took off, running as fast as she could.

56
00:03:43.352 --> 00:03:44.792
Gildong chased after her.

57
00:03:46.253 --> 00:03:50.275
Racing like the wind, he nearly caught up to her.

58
00:03:52.696 --> 00:03:54.556
The girl turned around, shocked.

59
00:03:54.576 --> 00:03:56.637
"You're fast!"

60
00:04:01.179 --> 00:04:02.940
Gildong ran even faster.

61
00:04:04.984 --> 00:04:06.065
"Give me my fan!"

62
00:04:09.226 --> 00:04:11.448
The girl darted behind a large rock.

63
00:04:12.989 --> 00:04:15.390
When Gildong got there, she was gone.

64
00:04:15.410 --> 00:04:19.032
"Ugh." Gildong groaned.

65
00:04:19.052 --> 00:04:20.913
"Where'd she go?"

66
00:04:22.714 --> 00:04:25.176
He wandered around and found a cave.

67
00:04:30.959 --> 00:04:32.660
she went in here," he thought.

68
00:04:34.136 --> 00:04:35.577
Gildong went inside.

69
00:04:38.359 --> 00:04:40.200
The cave was long and dark.

70
00:04:42.442 --> 00:04:44.883
At the back, light shone through a crack.

71
00:04:46.464 --> 00:04:48.206
Gildong peered through the crack.

72
00:04:48.226 --> 00:04:51.788
"Whoa!" he whispered.

73
00:04:53.709 --> 00:04:57.092
There was a huge village hidden within the mountains!
